# Cursor reads every AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md in the folder it runs in and in each parent folder up to the drive root,
# and a workspace's Cursor runs start inside this repo (workspaces/<name>). These lines keep Orchy's own instructions,
# which are for agents working on Orchy, out of a workspace's agent runs, and keep Orchy's private files out of
# Cursor's reach. Orchy refuses to start Cursor if the first three lines are missing (engines/cursor.mjs).
# Working on Orchy itself with Cursor: read README.md and CLAUDE.md yourself; Cursor won't load them from here.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/CLAUDE.local.md
/.env
/orchestrator/config.json
/orchestrator/voice-agents.json
/orchestrator/data/
